function officerEffectText(gid,v){return officerDecimal(((gid>>>24)&255)===3&&((gid>>>16)&255)===1?v/10:v)+((((gid>>>24)&255)===3&&((gid>>>16)&255)===1)?'%':'')}
function officerActiveText(gid,v){return officerDecimal(officerAmountSpells.has(gid)?v:v/10)+(officerAmountSpells.has(gid)?'×':'%')}
function officerPrisonChance(v){return 16+v/4}
function officerSkinBonusText(skinId,v){return officerDecimal(v/(skinId===68550658?1000:10))+(skinId===68550658?'×':'%')}
function officerExtraSlotCount(st){return st.star>=6?5:st.star===5?Math.min(4,Math.max(0,st.stage)):0}
